OL,3,GNEWSAPE teacher 'had sex with pupil'
OL,4,Aafter 'flirting'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA PE teacher who allegedly had sex with
OL,7,Fa 16-year-old pupil also slipped vapes
OL,8,Fin his coursework in class, a court has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FBronwen James, 30, of Chippenham,
OL,12,FWiltshire, is on trial at Winchester
OL,13,FCrown Court accused of four charges of
OL,14,Fsexual activity with the student at
OL,15,FBitterne Park School in Southampton,
OL,16,FHampshire.
OL,18,FEdward Culver, prosecuting, told the
OL,19,Fcourt on Wednesday the pair "messaged
OL,20,Fdaily", adding James told the pupil she
OL,21,F"cared about him" and "even discussed
OL,22,Fmoving in with each other".
